# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "snapped-growth-cut"
verdict good
note "growth, first reference: read k0-75: c narrows the centred card 100 -> 88 from its centre (k1-4); ca-cal-calc fades the leaving rows out and then springs the card 245 -> 64 -> 65 tall about its centre (k26-43); erase grows it back a letter at a time, each retargeting the spring with its velocity (k45-58), the returning rows cut by its box and the prompt riding its top edge; clear widens it 88 -> 100 (k66-72)"
date 2026-10-23
rev "94d165c6+changes"
approver "claude"
scenario 2f90aa15de106fa5
seal 2e4704a4dc4f20a0
